---
<Layout title="Contact SwiftFix Plumbing | Request a Quote" description="Contact SwiftFix Plumbing to request a plumbing quote or discuss an urgent plumbing problem in Leicester." current="/contact/"><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Contact</span><h1>Tell us what you need help with.</h1><p>Share a few details and SwiftFix Plumbing will get back to you about the next step.</p></div></section><section><div class="container quote-wrap"><div><span class="eyebrow">Request a quote</span><h2>Start with the essentials.</h2><p>Use the form for repairs and planned work. For an urgent leak or plumbing emergency, call instead.</p><div class="contact-panel"><h3>Emergency contact</h3><p>Placeholder number for the first website draft.</p><a href="tel:015982345678">01598 2345678</a><h3>Email</h3><a href="mailto:hello@swiftfixplumbing.co.uk">hello@swiftfixplumbing.co.uk</a></div></div><QuoteForm/></div></section></Layout>
